   182	It now remains to show that $r$-Multiple $k$-Orthogonal Vectors problem is conditionally hard.
   183	In order to do this, we leverage the fine-grained classification of the first-order properties provided in \cite{bringmann2019fine} (for details see Appendix \ref{appendix-mult-dom}).
