codex
Before treating the adversary panel as final, I’m checking one more domain-standard baseline: plain DPLL with unit propagation on the displayed 3-CNF. Gaussian elimination is an honest XOR-SAT reference, but if ordinary SAT propagation solves these instances at roughly the compact-route cost, the Track B claim would collapse.
